165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (This report concludes a month of steady organizational progress within Brainly HQ. In February, the server recorded a total of 3,632 messages, including 1,101 user messages, 1,217 bot messages, and 1,314 webhook messages, with no images, videos, or file uploads. A slight but natural decrease in overall message volume was observed, primarily resulting from a temporary bot outage that limited automated activity for part of the month.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (From a structural standpoint, the team remained stable and clearly defined, consisting of 12 core members: 4 moderators, 4 administrators, and 4 members of management. Each individual is counted according to their highest role, ensuring accurate and transparent statistics. Additionally, improvements to the welcome experience - such as a revised welcome screen and structured pings - helped maintain clarity and accessibility for new members joining the server.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (Looking forward, the focus is on strengthening reliability and expanding automation to prevent similar disruptions in the future. Planned development directions include further enhancements to bots, improved system stability, and better integration of automated tools to support moderation and engagement. These steps reinforce a clear path toward a more resilient, efficient, and scalable community ecosystem.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
